      "value": "This issue is a bit more complicated, I believe it can be triggered in other ways too, by just going in and out of play area, something may happen and make the joystick buttons not work. To fix this, I have to go back to hands and either lock, or unlock them. Either one will make the joysticks work again. It's like flipping a switch that brings the buttons back. Definitely buggy behavior and should be fixed.",
