  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Switch to hand tracking in VRC (using Quest 3 and latest steam hand)\n\n2. Lock your hands with the gesture \n\n3. Resume joystick control\n\nResult: The joystick buttons do not work after switching from locked hands\n\nExpected: The joysticks work normally, even if hands were locked. This shouldn't affect joysticks and nobody would want to have non-working buttons on the sticks at any point in time",
